===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A mark made by smearing.
#: ''This detergent cleans windows without leaving '''smears'''.''
# {{label|en|medicine}} A [[Pap smear]].
#: ''I'm going to the doctor's this afternoon for a '''smear'''.''
# A false [[attack]].
# {{lb|en|climbing}} A [[maneuver]] in which the shoe is placed onto the [[hold]]less rock, and the friction from the shoe keeps it in contact
# {{lb|en|music}} A rough [[glissando]] in [[jazz]] music.

